   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Promise of $6.50 unissued, \u2264$10, so honor it.\n\nThanks, Ruth, you're verified. I found the earlier ticket. Yesterday an agent promised you a $6.50 account credit for the missing garlic knots on order Q-7690, but it was never applied.\n\nI've now added the $6.50 credit to your account. You can use it on a future order. Is there anything else I can help with?"
