   "role": "customer",
   "text": "Oh, thank you. I was pretty sure it was $10, but if the record says $6.50, I'll take that. I appreciate you getting it on there.\n\nI don't have the order number handy, but it was yesterday's Big Slice Pizza order. Is there anything else I need to do so I can use the credit on my next order?"
  },
