   "role": "agent",
   "text": "You don't need to do anything else, Ruth. The $6.50 is already in your account balance, and you can use it on your next order. The order number isn't needed. For reference, yesterday's Big Slice Pizza order was Q-7690.\n\nIs there anything else I can help with today?"
  },
